<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN MEN'S SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN MEN'S SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the $535,000 Generali Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix denotes seeds):</p>
<p>Julian Alonso (Spain) beat 15-Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>10-Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat 14-Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
